# Temperance marker — cli#460 init brand mark
- date: 2026-11-02
- branch: feat/460-init-brand-mark
- scope-decision: smallest shape is one pure function in a new lib file plus one
  call site in init.ts, following the init-value-test-block.ts pattern exactly.
  Blast radius: the human banner on a successful non-json init only. The --json
  path is untouched, so adopter tooling that parses the report cannot break.
- drift-trigger: if this needs a postinstall script, a color layer, or a change to
  the report shape, stop and re-scope. Any of those three is a different ticket.
